Package: kapitan-pazar
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash (>= 4.0), apt, dpkg, sudo
Description: KAPiTaN OS Turkish package manager
 pazar is a Turkish-language package manager front-end for KAPiTaN OS.
 It wraps stable apt-get/apt-cache/dpkg-query interfaces, presents plans
 in Turkish before applying changes, and requires explicit confirmation
 for all mutating operations.
